\newlabel{tab:complex_accuracy}{{2}{10}{Accuracy (\%) on HAM10000 and ImageNet-1K under different backbones and data distributions. Results are averaged over 5 runs across 200 clients (mean $\pm $ std). (A), (B), and (C) denote different client-edge and edge-cloud aggregation intervals. \textbf {Bold} and \underline {underline} indicate the best and second-best federated results, respectively}{table.caption.5}{}}
