\newlabel{fig:computation}{{3}{12}{Client-side RAM usage (MB) over 200 rounds. The chart contrasts the high, stable memory cost of full-model methods ($\sim $600 MB) with the low, sub-100 MB cost of split-learning methods (SplitFed, HSFL, and Ours)}{figure.caption.7}{}}
